  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">“Orientation Session on IIC for faculties and students”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized an “Orientation Session on IIC for faculties and students” in association with Institutions Innovation Council on 28th July 2021. Dr. Rathnakar G, President, IIC – ATMECE, being an innovation ambassador himself highlighted the importance of IIC in HEIs and also disseminated the scope, benefits and mission of IIC in developing and nurturing the innovation and entrepreneurship spirit in HEIs to all the faculties and students of the institution.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
